WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.109 --> 00:00:12.854
One day the tortoise was taking a nice, slow walk.

2
00:00:12.855 --> 00:00:17.166
He was going around the lake. Suddenly—

3
00:00:17.167 --> 00:00:21.361
whoosh! Wind rushed at him as the hare raced

4
00:00:21.362 --> 00:00:24.667
past. The tortoise flopped over onto his

5
00:00:24.668 --> 00:00:28.845
back. "Oops!" The hare laughed

6
00:00:28.846 --> 00:00:31.373
loudly. Tortoise turned himself back over.

7
00:00:31.374 --> 00:00:33.835
"It's not funny, Hare.

8
00:00:33.836 --> 00:00:37.277
You should be careful of others on the path!"

9
00:00:37.278 --> 00:00:41.474
"Well, slowpokes shouldn't be on the path," Hare said.

10
00:00:41.475 --> 00:00:44.095
"It's for speedy runners like me."

11
00:00:44.096 --> 00:00:46.702
Just then a fox walked by.

12
00:00:46.703 --> 00:00:50.874
He saw the two animals' angry expressions.

13
00:00:50.875 --> 00:00:53.466
"What's wrong?" he asked.

14
00:00:53.467 --> 00:00:58.486
"This path is for speedy runners, not slow walkers!" Hare said.

15
00:00:58.487 --> 00:01:02.396
"The path is for everyone!" Tortoise said.

16
00:01:02.397 --> 00:01:04.699
They glared at each other.

17
00:01:04.700 --> 00:01:08.290
"Let's have a race," Hare finally said. "The

18
00:01:08.291 --> 00:01:11.432
winner can decide who gets to use the path." "Fine,"

19
00:01:11.433 --> 00:01:15.401
Tortoise said. "We'll race!" "I

20
00:01:15.402 --> 00:01:18.364
can be the judge," Fox said. "We'll

21
00:01:18.365 --> 00:01:21.909
have the race tomorrow," Hare said. "We'll

22
00:01:21.910 --> 00:01:24.798
race once around the lake." "I'll

23
00:01:24.799 --> 00:01:31.806
be here!" Tortoise said. ***

24
00:01:31.807 --> 00:01:36.381
The next day lots of animals gathered to watch the race.

25
00:01:36.382 --> 00:01:39.737
The hare and the tortoise met at the starting line.

26
00:01:39.738 --> 00:01:43.035
The hare grinned. "You'll never beat me.

27
00:01:43.036 --> 00:01:46.952
I'm fast, and you're slow. Just give up, Tortoise."

28
00:01:46.953 --> 00:01:50.381
"I want to race," the tortoise said calmly. "Then

29
00:01:50.382 --> 00:01:53.085
we'll see who the winner is." The

30
00:01:53.086 --> 00:01:56.268
fox came over to start the race. "On

31
00:01:56.269 --> 00:02:00.350
your mark . . . get set . . . go!" The

32
00:02:00.351 --> 00:02:02.948
two racers took off. The

33
00:02:02.949 --> 00:02:05.634
hare instantly shot ahead. "See

34
00:02:05.635 --> 00:02:12.843
you later, Tortoise—much later!" he said, laughing. ***

35
00:02:12.844 --> 00:02:15.794
The hare ran fast for a while.

36
00:02:15.795 --> 00:02:19.296
When he looked back, he couldn't see the tortoise at all.

37
00:02:19.297 --> 00:02:22.307
"I'm way ahead of him!" he thought.

38
00:02:22.308 --> 00:02:26.375
Up ahead, Hare spotted some delicious-looking carrots. "Yum!

39
00:02:26.376 --> 00:02:29.273
I'll stop for a snack. That

40
00:02:29.274 --> 00:02:32.852
slow tortoise will never catch up to me!" ***

41
00:02:32.853 --> 00:02:37.113
The tortoise kept walking along at the same steady pace.

42
00:02:37.114 --> 00:02:41.197
Following the path, he kept his eyes straight ahead.

43
00:02:41.198 --> 00:02:46.302
"Tortoise! Tortoise!" Some animals cheered his name.

44
00:02:46.303 --> 00:02:53.570
"You can do it!"

45
00:02:53.571 --> 00:02:56.255
*** "Aah!" The hare suddenly woke

46
00:02:56.256 --> 00:02:58.733
up. "I fell asleep after my

47
00:02:58.734 --> 00:03:03.981
snack!" He looked back, but the tortoise was nowhere in sight.

48
00:03:03.982 --> 00:03:07.120
"Phew!" He got up and raced toward the finish line.

49
00:03:07.121 --> 00:03:11.010
When he got close, he gasped in surprise.

50
00:03:11.011 --> 00:03:14.689
The tortoise was crossing the finish line!

51
00:03:14.690 --> 00:03:18.501
"Impossible!" Hare cried.

52
00:03:18.502 --> 00:03:21.655
Tortoise looked back at Hare and smiled.

53
00:03:21.656 --> 00:03:23.938
"You're very fast, Hare.

54
00:03:23.939 --> 00:03:28.923
But slow but steady wins the race!"

